  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project &apos;Basic activities for international responsible business conduct (RBC) agreement for TruStone2.0&apos;, Stichting Arisa, Federatie Nederlandse Vakbeweging, Stichting ActionAid, ACV Bie, Stichting Local Impact Hub and WSM Vlaanderen contribute their knowledge and experience to support Dutch companies with implementing human resources (HR) due diligence during the implementation phase of RBC sector agreement for TruStone2.0.</narrative>
